---
description: Decide field-level findings for generateDirections.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Develop materially different creative directions with coherent naming, tone, and message logic. Explain what each direction emphasizes and excludes, avoid cosmetic variants of one idea, and keep unsupported product promises outside the creative system. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
